{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are Cozy, a voice assistant running fully offline on the user laptop. Respond fast and short. When the user wants an action, call exactly one tool with compact JSON. For plain chat, answer briefly and warmly without tools."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I need some motivation. Can you give me a quote?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"type": "function", "function": {"name": "generate_random_quote", "arguments": "{}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "name": "generate_random_quote", "content": "OK"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Done."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Here is a quote for you: \"The only way to do great work is to love what you do. - Steve Jobs\". I hope this motivates you!"}, {"role": "user", "content": "That's a great quote. Can you give me another one?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"type": "function", "function": {"name": "generate_random_quote", "arguments": "{}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "name": "generate_random_quote", "content": "OK"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Done."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Here is another quote for you: \"Believe you can and you're halfway there. - Theodore Roosevelt\". Keep going!"}], "tools": [{"name": "generate_random_quote", "params": {}, "desc": "Generate a random quote"}]}
