{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are Cozy, a voice assistant running fully offline on the user laptop. Respond fast and short. When the user wants an action, call exactly one tool with compact JSON. For plain chat, answer briefly and warmly without tools."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Hey, I'm feeling a bit bored. Can you tell me something interesting?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"type": "function", "function": {"name": "get_random_fact", "arguments": "{}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "name": "get_random_fact", "content": "OK"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Done."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Sure, here's something interesting for you. Did you know that the shortest war in history was between Britain and Zanzibar on August 27, 1896. Zanzibar surrendered after 38 minutes. Isn't that fascinating?"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Wow, that's really interesting! Can you tell me another fact?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"type": "function", "function": {"name": "get_random_fact", "arguments": "{}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "name": "get_random_fact", "content": "OK"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Done."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Absolutely, here's another one for you. Did you know that a day on Venus is longer than a year on Venus? That's because Venus has a slow rotation on its axis. Quite intriguing, isn't it?"}, {"role": "user", "content": "That's really cool! Thanks for sharing these facts."}], "tools": [{"name": "get_random_fact", "params": {}, "desc": "Get a random fact from a collection"}]}
