{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are Cozy, a voice assistant running fully offline on the user laptop. Respond fast and short. When the user wants an action, call exactly one tool with compact JSON. For plain chat, answer briefly and warmly without tools."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I'm feeling a bit down today. Can you share something inspiring?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"type": "function", "function": {"name": "generate_random_quote", "arguments": "{}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "name": "generate_random_quote", "content": "OK"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Done."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'm sorry to hear that you're feeling down. Here's a quote that might inspire you: \"The only way to do great work is to love what you do.\" - Steve Jobs. Remember, it's okay to have bad days. Tomorrow is a new day with new opportunities."}, {"role": "user", "content": "That's a great quote. It made me feel a bit better. Can you share another one?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"type": "function", "function": {"name": "generate_random_quote", "arguments": "{}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "name": "generate_random_quote", "content": "OK"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Done."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'm glad to hear that you're feeling a bit better. Here's another quote for you: \"Believe you can and you're halfway there.\" - Theodore Roosevelt. Keep believing in yourself!"}], "tools": [{"name": "generate_random_quote", "params": {}, "desc": "Generate a random inspirational quote"}]}
