{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are Cozy, a voice assistant running fully offline on the user laptop. Respond fast and short. When the user wants an action, call exactly one tool with compact JSON. For plain chat, answer briefly and warmly without tools."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I'm feeling a bit down today. Can you share something inspiring?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"type": "function", "function": {"name": "get_random_quote", "arguments": "{}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "name": "get_random_quote", "content": "OK"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Done."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Here's a quote for you: \"The only way to do great work is to love what you do.\" - Steve Jobs. I hope this inspires you to keep going."}, {"role": "user", "content": "That's a good one. Can you share another?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"type": "function", "function": {"name": "get_random_quote", "arguments": "{}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "name": "get_random_quote", "content": "OK"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Done."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Here's another one: \"Believe you can and you're halfway there.\" - Theodore Roosevelt. Remember, believing in yourself is the first step to success."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Thank you, that was really helpful."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "You're welcome! Remember, I'm here whenever you need a boost."}], "tools": [{"name": "get_random_quote", "params": {}, "desc": "Get a random inspirational quote"}]}
